# Registry

The registry lists organisations that Ismail and Literacity have verified as possessing Ismail's Primitives in their decision structures. It lists passes only, and a failed audit stays private. Absence from this list means no verification is on record. Anyone who wants to know whether a claim to use Ismail's Primitives was checked can write to [literacity@outlook.com](mailto:literacity@outlook.com), and Ismail can confirm or deny.

The first cohort of verifications will be published by Q2 2027, and the registry lists each one as it is issued. Each entry is valid for twelve months from its date. The [certification terms](terms.md) set out what an entry asserts and records.

